    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sharia ra Mlungu riandikilo aighu ya magho",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Musa na waghosi wa Israeli wikawilaghira wandu wikighamba, “Wadienyi malaghiro ghose nimlaghiragha idime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituku mruwukagha Moda ghwa Jordani mngie ijo isanga BWANA Mlungu onyu umnekagha, mdunge magho mabaa, mughikabe lipu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.8.30+JOS.8.31+JOS.8.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jos. 8.30-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kughiandika aighu yaro sharia iri rose na malaghiro. Kukameria kungia ijo isanga jinorie nandighi, ijo BWANA Mlungu onyu umnekagha, ijo orewilaghirieghe weke ndeyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkameria kuruwuka Moda ghwa Jordani, mdunge agho magho gha malagho namlaghira idime aighu ya Mghondi ghwa Ebali na kughikaba lipu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na aho mumuaghie BWANA Mlungu onyu madhabahu gha magho ghisewachilo na kilambo chingi cha chuma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuf. 20.25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumuaghie BWANA Mlungu onyu madhabahu ya magho ghisewachilo, nenyo mchamfunyira BWANA Mlungu onyu vizongona vekora aighu yaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfunye vizongona va mapatano muvijie aho, na kuboilwa imbiri ya BWANA Mlungu onyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho malagho gha ihi sharia, mughiandikie aighu ya agho magho mwaghikaba lipu worinyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Musa na wakohani Walawi wikawizera Waisraeli wose, “Sikirenyi ee wandu wa Israeli: Idime mwawuya wandu wa BWANA Mlungu onyu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwa huwo mumsikire na kuwadia sharia rake rose nimnekagha idime.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Njowe kwa wundu gholegha kusikira",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Musa ukawilaghira wandu ijo ituku jeni ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mkameria kuruwuka Jordani, kichuku cha Simeoni, na cha Lawi, na cha Juda, na cha Isakari, na cha Josefu, na cha Benjamini, wichakaia kimusi aighu ya Mghondi ghwa Gerizimu kurasimia wandu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.11.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuk. 11.29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.8.33+JOS.8.34+JOS.8.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jos. 8.33-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kichuku cha Reubeni, na cha Gadi, na cha Asheri, na cha Zebluni, na cha Dani, na cha Naftali, wichakaia kimusi aighu ya Mghondi ghwa Ebali kwa wundu ghwa njowe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Walawi wichawizera wandu wa Israeli wose kwa lwaka lubaa:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
